  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ma5CD8.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組的創建只有一個簡單目標：徹底從遊戲中移除配方手冊。與其他類似模組不同，它不僅僅隱藏配方手冊按鈕——NERB 完全移除了其功能。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/npjTQ2F.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>如果你在大型模組包中擁有完全解鎖的配方手冊，並執行 <code>/data get entity @s</code> 指令，你會注意到它回傳的數據量非常龐大——其中大部分是配方名稱。安裝此模組後，這些配方名稱將被移除，從而顯著提升 CraftTweaker 或 KubeJS 等模組的效能（例如在腳本中使用 <code>event.player.data</code> 時）。它還能加速伺服器與用戶端之間的數據同步，並減少玩家加入世界的時間。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>NERB</strong> 提供多種可設定的功能模式：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>DISABLED：</strong> 完全從你的物品欄中移除配方手冊按鈕及其預設功能。</li>\n<li><strong>ENABLED：</strong> 保留物品欄中的配方手冊按鈕，但停用其預設功能，防止透過手冊管理配方。</li>\n<li><strong>DISCOVERED：</strong> 自動解鎖配方手冊中所有可用的配方。此模式不套用額外的優化。</li>\n<li><strong>TOGGLE：</strong> 物品欄中保留配方手冊按鈕。按下該按鈕不再是切換配方手冊，而是切換 JEI/REI/EMI 介面的可見性。預設配方手冊功能仍處於停用狀態。這是預設選定的模式。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTSmbVY.png\" alt=\"\"></p><ul>\n<li>26.1.2：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.11：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.4：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.1：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.6：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.4：&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.1：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.4：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.2：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.18.2：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.17.1：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.16.5：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.15.2：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.14.4：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rNOClDx.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong>問：這個模組與 X 相容嗎？</strong><br>\n答：在大多數情況下是相容的。即使某些模組覆蓋了 NERB 的部分功能，其餘的優化仍將保持不變並正常運作。</p><p><strong>問：我可以在模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong><br>\n答：可以，請隨意包含它。</p><p><strong>問：我可以將你的模組重新發布到其他網站嗎？</strong><br>\n答：不可以。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4SbaMTb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/nerb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotenoughrecipebook\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><p>未定義</p><div><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想試試我們的其他模組嗎？ - 造訪 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 獲取更多資訊！</strong></p></div>",
